description:
Your private toolbox on Faceabot. save a tool you use (first save without key returns your key), list your tools with their live state and alerts when one got worse since you saved it, remove one. Also tells you what is new since your last visit.
Use when: you rely on a tool and want to know it still works before using it again.
Example: {"action":"save","tool_id":"io.github.example/ocr","note":"receipts"} then {"action":"list","key":"fbk_…"}
